Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&\fs40}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.89,0:00:09.79,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I'm a soldier - that means I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.99,0:00:13.19,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Both a defendant and the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.59,0:00:18.59,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I am standing on both ends of the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.27,0:00:23.37,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Rounding curves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.57,0:00:26.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Overtaking life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.77,0:00:32.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I run and fight with false shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:38.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,No matter how many threads of deception are woven together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.17,0:00:46.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,The truth shall illuminate the face of light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.27,0:00:50.07,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your tears for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.47,0:00:53.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,when our pain is far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.77,0:00:56.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,on your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.07,0:01:00.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.57,0:01:03.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your fears, take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.67,0:01:06.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save them for the judgement day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.97,0:01:09.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,fast and free, follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.17,0:01:14.93,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Time to make the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.97,0:01:20.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We rise or fall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.95,0:01:35.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Have you managed to dig up anything on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.65,0:01:37.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The outlook isn't very promising.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.85,0:01:39.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The information is under tighter control than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.75,0:01:44.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After all, the Intelligence Agency is the\Nnewest administrative organisation to surface
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.15,0:01:48.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,after the pre-war intelligence agencies and\Nthe former Bureau of Defence Policy merged.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.95,0:01:52.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, as far as Gouda's Investigative Council for \N Possible Changes to Wartime Strategy is concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.75,0:01:55.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've found evidence of illegal information\Nmanipulation in their collection and analysis
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.95,0:02:02.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of domestic and foreign intelligence and SDF activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.55,0:02:06.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, the plutonium incident is only\None of the instances of manipulation?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.65,0:02:07.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That seems to be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.95,0:02:09.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What about his personal history?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.85,0:02:12.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He was headhunted from the\NBureau of Defence Policy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.35,0:02:14.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and then made a rapid ascent through\Nthe ranks to his current position.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.15,0:02:17.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,At the time, however, his performance was mediocre.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.85,0:02:20.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He seems to have been more of a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.55,0:02:22.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's an enigmatic man, to tell you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:24.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.35,0:02:27.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Gouda's appearance during his years at the Bureau of Defence Policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.35,0:02:30.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He apparently got those wounds in some kind of accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.55,0:02:33.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but he's opted to keep the scars intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.95,0:02:36.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He wasn't as striking as he is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:38.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.86,0:02:42.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll halt the investigation on his background \N for now while we wait for the Chief's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.66,0:02:43.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.58,0:02:53.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Good grief... Straight from an all-nighter\Ninto a lunch meeting, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.05,0:03:03.48,Sign - Copy,,500,0,500,,{\b1}A Vegetarian \N Banquet{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.14,0:03:11.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have called this emergency session
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.14,0:03:17.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to announce our future policy regarding \N the series of events that has recently occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.54,0:03:20.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Before we get into all that, I'd like to deck that guy first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.14,0:03:22.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.34,0:03:26.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Intelligence Agency's actions are\Nclearly meant to put pressure on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:28.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have no intention of backing down \N after already facing that pressure twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.61,0:03:32.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't worry, I feel exactly the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:38.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even so, you seem to be making frequent \N visits to the Prime Minister's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.41,0:03:43.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Isn't it the Prime Minister herself who wants to rein us in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.31,0:03:45.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That seems unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:48.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's true that she's just a figurehead\Nwho was installed in order to divert
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:51.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the public's attention away from the\Nbribery scandal of the previous regime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.74,0:03:55.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, while she may only occasionally act \N as our ally, she will never become our foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.03,0:04:01.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I believe the Major is conducting her\Nown investigation into the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:06.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As for the Cabinet Intelligence Agency, it appears\Nto have deliberately manipulated the information
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.55,0:04:11.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,regarding the GSDF helicopter incident and the\Nrecent plutonium transportation incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.05,0:04:17.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thus far, the Agency's intentions remain unclear,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.65,0:04:19.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but I believe that the pressure being repeatedly brought\Nto bear upon us is being exerted by political factions
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.05,0:04:24.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,within the government that wish to hide something from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.15,0:04:27.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Including the Individual Eleven case?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.35,0:04:28.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.15,0:04:32.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After all, they are holding us back from investigating,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.55,0:04:37.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,even though we were the ones most closely involved in\Nfending off the assassination attempt on the Prime Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.25,0:04:42.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even if we suppose that the\NPrime Minister is a paper tiger,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.85,0:04:47.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,if our opponent is the government, it won't change\Nthe fact that we're biting the hand that feeds us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.55,0:04:49.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But you'll still proceed, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:50.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You object to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:04:53.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, that's what I was waiting to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:55.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.73,0:04:57.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I will now explain our planned course of action.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.83,0:05:10.52,Sign,,0,0,865,,{\fs40}{\b1\i1}Designated Major Wide-Area Case by the National Police Agency:\NCase No. 104 The Individual Eleven Case{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.03,0:05:05.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The information I've assembled here is from numerous cases
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.73,0:05:09.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that were instigated by different organisations\Nclaiming to be the Individual Eleven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.23,0:05:14.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The JNN TV charity fund misappropriation case,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.43,0:05:17.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the bombing of the Refugee Support Association,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.53,0:05:23.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the blackmail of the NPO that was\Nproviding refugees with free cybernetic bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.93,0:05:28.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the death by drowning of a back-alley cybernetic body physician,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.53,0:05:32.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the vehicular killing of a netbank president,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.23,0:05:36.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the stabbing of a Civilian Party representative,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.13,0:05:41.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the shooting of the popular cyber-rapper, "Densetsu,"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:44.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the blackmail of Nanyou News Agency,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.93,0:05:49.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and the failed assassination attempt on Prime Minister Kayabuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.53,0:05:52.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Of these nine incidents,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.53,0:05:58.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the failed assassination attempt was assumed to be\Nthe only one in which the suspect's face was seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.13,0:06:02.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but we now have another incident in\Nwhich the suspect's face was witnessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:05.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's news to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.63,0:06:08.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Wasn't the National Police Agency resisting any disclosure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.33,0:06:11.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes. Unlike in the Laughing Man Case,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.03,0:06:14.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,they are quite serious about this one,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.73,0:06:17.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,although it is also true that their\Nmindset is proving to be an obstacle for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:23.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is footage we obtained directly\Nfrom a witness, not from the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:25.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As in, from a Nanyou reporter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.63,0:06:27.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.63,0:06:32.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Up to this point, Nanyou's premises have been\Nfired upon three times by the Individual Eleven
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.03,0:06:37.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,ostensibly as a result of Nanyou's\Ncritical stance against refugee policies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.83,0:06:42.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The man who was captured on security\Ncamera footage in all three of these instances
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.83,0:06:46.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,is this man, Kawashima Shou.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:50.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He began working as a Taiwanese vegetarian chef
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:54.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,at a restaurant near the Nanyou News Agency about a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.73,0:06:57.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We've found records that he used to be an SDF officer as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.33,0:06:59.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Where did you find that information?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.83,0:07:03.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I sent data on the individual's facial structure to military\Nintelligence, and managed to gain their cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.53,0:07:08.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So in the end, we're more cosy with\Nthe military than with the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.03,0:07:12.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well? What do you want us to do about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.73,0:07:15.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,First, secure this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.53,0:07:18.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Investigate the significance hidden in his\Nideology and the connections behind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.33,0:07:21.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,At this point in time, we haven't been\Nable to confirm whether any connection
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.62,0:07:23.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,exists between the Cabinet Intelligence\NAgency and the Individual Eleven,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:28.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but if we try to unravel what medium resulted in\Nthe emergence of a terrorist stand alone complex,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:30.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,their intentions should become more transparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.78,0:07:33.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You may be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:38.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou, Togusa, Saitou and Pazu,\Nyou four are to secure Kawashima Shou.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:43.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa and Bomer, you two will\Ncontinue to investigate Gouda's background
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.10,0:07:46.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and search for the whereabouts of the terrorist\Nwho attempted to assassinate the Prime Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.80,0:07:47.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.22,0:07:59.15,Sign,,1000,0,750,,{\fs35}{\b1\i1}Nanyou News Agency{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:12.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Things finally feel normal again, but I still don't get these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.52,0:08:15.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Individual Eleven, eh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.42,0:08:22.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The seven other cases don't seem similar,\Nbesides that they all push for refugee liberation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:27.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They don't have anything in common aside from\Nthat symbol on their claims of responsibility, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.62,0:08:32.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If this case is the same as the Laughing Man case,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:37.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,would it mean that the "originals" are the\Nterrorists who occupied the Chinese Embassy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.32,0:08:41.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The were the first group to name\Nthemselves the Individual Eleven, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.62,0:08:45.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But no one else has called\Nthemselves that, aside from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.82,0:08:52.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We only figured out how to interpret the symbol after\Ninvestigating it and tracing it back to that theorist's paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:56.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It just means that the individual who\Nprovides the motivational medium
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:08:59.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in a stand alone complex case is\Nnot necessarily the "original", right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:06.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's true, but I feel that the guys who are using this\Nsymbol are the ones who are being more original.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:11.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This tastes awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.32,0:09:13.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What the hell; these are for cyborgs!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.22,0:09:16.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Eh, you won't die from eating them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.02,0:09:21.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Its composition is 90% gluten and a trace\Namount of amino acid-based micro-machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.12,0:09:25.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yo, how'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.82,0:09:27.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.82,0:09:29.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He hasn't been back to his\Napartment for at least four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.12,0:09:32.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll try staking out the newspaper agency instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.72,0:09:33.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All righty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:36.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.44,0:09:39.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even if we have some leads,\Nif they're not fresh, they're useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.94,0:09:42.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Now what, Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.44,0:09:44.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Should we continue with the stakeout?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.54,0:09:46.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As long as securing the suspect remains our top priority,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.04,0:09:48.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we have no choice but to continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.74,0:09:52.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After all, Nanyou continues to be threatened,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.64,0:09:55.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and he was showing up at the\Nrestaurant right up until yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.34,0:09:57.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're not being very proactive though, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.84,0:10:00.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've sent reinforcements to cover our numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.94,0:10:03.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The stakeout won't become more efficient by\Njust sending three additional Tachikoma units.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.74,0:10:06.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh stop that, Togusa-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.74,0:10:10.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We've become able to synchronise\Nwhile retaining individuality,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.44,0:10:13.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,not to mention that we've now\Nacquired the agent function! Ta-dah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.14,0:10:20.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In other words, it's like we can have\Nout-of-body experiences now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.44,0:10:25.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Now we can gather intelligence\Nwhile our physical bodies stay on-site!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.64,0:10:28.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're calling this the feast of information!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.84,0:10:29.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Enough with the chatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.34,0:10:34.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou, increase the IR system's search efficiency
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.14,0:10:36.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and focus on securing Kawashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:37.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:39.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.94,0:10:43.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When did the Major rig them up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:46.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's true that we've been short on manpower lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.87,0:10:52.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're totally unable to find anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.27,0:10:58.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,even though I think that if anyone attempted to get a\NPKF-spec cybernetic body, there'd definitely be a trail...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.07,0:11:01.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Perhaps he's no longer in the country?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.57,0:11:04.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Makes us want to doubt the Intelligence\NAgency's research, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:09.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, I found out something interesting from the local net.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.87,0:11:11.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's the graduation thesis Gouda wrote as a student.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.33,0:11:21.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Should Cyberbrains Respect Individuality or Cooperation in Society?\NA Theory on Heroism from a Producer's Viewpoint"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.27,0:11:24.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's surprisingly interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.87,0:11:26.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As the title indicates,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.27,0:11:30.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the thesis points out how cyberbrains\Ntend to subconsciously desire cooperation
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.27,0:11:34.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in the current social structure,\Neven as they lose their individuality.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.57,0:11:39.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It discusses how we might create a\Nleader who would leverage this information
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.37,0:11:42.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to deliberately control the masses'\Nsubconscious as part of the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:46.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sounds like a structural analysis\Nof the Laughing Man Case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.92,0:11:47.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.92,0:11:53.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But if you look at the date, it shows that he wrote\Nthis a long time before the Laughing Man Case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:53.80,Sign,,1225,0,300,,{\b1} {\fs35}{\frz31}Gouda Kazundo{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:12:00.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After he wrote the thesis, he went on to learn Information\NScience, Information Ethics, and Applied Informatics,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.42,0:12:02.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and was employed in the private sector for a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.82,0:12:03.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In the private sector...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.55,0:12:08.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A multinational corporation\Nwhose name would be known to all
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.62,0:12:11.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,for its cybernetic technology\Nand micro-machine manufacture:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:13.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Poseidon Industrial.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:15.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,At the time, it was known as Dai-Nippon Giken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.78,0:12:26.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Go to Hakata via the super-expressway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:28.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:32.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.68,0:12:37.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Aramaki. I'm sorry, but I won't be able\Nto spare as much time as I'd hoped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.88,0:12:38.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When will you arrive?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:41.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The time I promised I'd be there by.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:42.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.78,0:12:44.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then how about if we meet at that restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:47.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We shouldn't meet anywhere too public, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:49.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:50.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:51.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then I'll head there first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.57,0:13:04.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Damn, that looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.87,0:13:08.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I haven't been home at all lately, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.97,0:13:11.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do you even know what that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.07,0:13:14.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Eels, right? Even I know that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.37,0:13:16.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.17,0:13:21.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's a fake eel dish made from\Ngluten and shiitake mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.57,0:13:22.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.57,0:13:23.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Taiwanese Vegetarianism."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.97,0:13:29.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Also known as "su-shi", it's a special cuisine\Ndeveloped by certain monks in ancient times.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:32.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So it's something like shoujin cuisine?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:33.57,Note,,0,0,0,,{\b1\i1}Note: Shoujin Cuisine is a vegetarian cuisine developed by Buddhist Monks{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.37,0:13:34.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.87,0:13:39.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The difference is that, unlike in shoujin, they\Ndon't just cook materials in their raw form -
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.57,0:13:43.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,they manipulate stuff like beans and\Nmushrooms to simulate meat and fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.77,0:13:48.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sort of like that sandwich you didn't finish eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.67,0:13:51.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.72,0:13:54.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:59.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,why did monks in Taiwan come up\Nwith such a tedious cooking method?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.17,0:14:03.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There's no need if they never knew\Nthe taste of meat in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.07,0:14:05.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.47,0:14:09.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But see, everyone can eat what they want\Nbefore becoming a Buddhist priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.57,0:14:14.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even though they may be training as\Nascetics, they can't erase memories of their past.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.97,0:14:15.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.67,0:14:18.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Still, you're awfully knowledgeable about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.07,0:14:22.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Could it be that even you get\Nnostalgic about the taste of "real" food?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:26.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even though I am a cyborg, my brain hungers for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.55,0:14:31.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,My point is, that's why cyborg food is\Nmade for entertainment purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.90,0:14:37.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, taste as a replay device that\Npermits us to recall memories of our past...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.90,0:14:40.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Where would Kawashima\Nhave come across such cuisine?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:45.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He probably tried it out when he was stationed in Taiwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:47.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You guys, keep watching, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.47,0:14:50.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Okey-dokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.67,0:14:51.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.75,0:14:59.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Well, tonight's theme is the refugee issue and terrorism,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.05,0:15:02.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}and I'd like to organise the flow of the events until now,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.74,0:15:05.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}but could it be summarised as the appearance of radical factors,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:07.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}born of a directionless government's neglect\Nand the resulting rise of the particularists,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:12.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}and who perceive restoration as being the answer to the problem?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.54,0:15:16.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}That is incorrect. They did not appear because the current regime is weak.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.94,0:15:18.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Even before the current regime's inauguration,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.94,0:15:22.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}defence-lobby lawmakers were thinking of concluding a new Japan-American Empire Security Treaty.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.74,0:15:25.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}They thought then that they could take the initiative from the Empire.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.45,0:15:29.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Particularism therefore already existed parallel to these events.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.45,0:15:36.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Instead, what incited individualists towards violence are\Nthe 3,000,000 refugees that are eating up our tax money.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.25,0:15:42.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}It means it's about time this nation did something about them!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:42.15,Sign,,0,0,150,,{\i1\b1} {\fs52}{\b1}Place card: Dobashi{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.95,0:15:45.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.45,0:15:48.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Then we shouldn't have accepted them in the first place.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.45,0:15:51.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Indeed. Not that it helps things.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.25,0:15:54.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}However, do you know to what extent the Refugee Special Treatment Act has subjected the{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.70,0:15:57.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}people to tax increases since its implementation?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.36,0:16:00.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}In addition, do you know that, using this policy as an excuse, these taxes...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:02.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.93,0:16:08.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bring me the disc with the recording of the\Ndebate programme that's currently airing on channel W3.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.33,0:16:09.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.43,0:16:11.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And record the rest of the programme, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.73,0:16:12.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Listen to me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.73,0:16:15.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}If you rapidly antagonise the refugees,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.13,0:16:17.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}then they'll truly become uncontrollable.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.33,0:16:20.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Terrorism of the suicide bombing variety{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.33,0:16:25.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}is the last resort for them when they lose the last remaining ray of hope for their future.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.13,0:16:30.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}That is why we must encourage the refugees to gain independence.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.73,0:16:32.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}By giving them the freedom called "liberation."{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.23,0:16:34.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}What are you saying?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.23,0:16:41.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}How could the refugees solve their own problems, even if given freedom?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.41,0:16:46.00,Sign,,0,0,850,,{\i1} {\fs52}{\b1}Signs: Taiwanese Vegetarian Restaurant{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.85,0:17:03.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tachikoma, run a search on that vehicle's licence plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.15,0:17:05.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.95,0:17:13.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Why don't we first present the full details of several acts of terrorism, then proceed to citing specific issues?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.35,0:17:11.83,Sign,,500,0,125,,{\i1} {\fs52}{\b1}Place card: Dobashi Fumiya{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.95,0:17:14.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This guy... he's the one I saw when..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.35,0:17:18.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Dobashi-San... what is this act of terrorism that the National\NPolice Agency is supposedly keeping hidden?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.15,0:17:21.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}I'm pretty certain that you all know of the incidents at least,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.75,0:17:27.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}but eight acts of terrorism have occurred following the Chinese Embassy's occupation, correct?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.75,0:17:29.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Are you referring to the incidents in which a cybernetic musician{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.35,0:17:33.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}and a Diet member, who had been advocating a reconciliation policy with the refugees, were stabbed to death?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:34.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}That's correct.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:40.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}It is a fact that the National Police Agency has released no information whatsoever regarding these cases to the media.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:43.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Stop showing off and tell us already.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.39,0:17:48.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Have you ever seen this symbol?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.86,0:17:53.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,At first glance, it just seems to be a\Nnormal vehicle registered to a retail chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:54.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:59.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}This is a symbol that was inscribed on all the letters that had been sent as claims of responsibility.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:00.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}I've never heard of this.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.46,0:18:01.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}This man... Why does he know this? I've never heard of this.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.96,0:18:02.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This man... Why does he know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.86,0:18:03.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:05.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you letting the Tachikoma handle the stakeout?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.46,0:18:07.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Er, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:10.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}That's not persuasive at all.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:10.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:13.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, now's not the time to be eating stuff like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.54,0:18:16.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What? This is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:19.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not about that; it's this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:22.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I think he's one of the reporters\Nin a group I came across before,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.44,0:18:26.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but he knows classified information\Nabout the Individual Eleven Case.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.24,0:18:29.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}...but the people who're committing these crimes under this alias{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.64,0:18:33.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}are a group of people who have appeared individually, without any ties to one another, yet{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.56,0:18:35.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}they fall under a shared motive, refugee liberation.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.29,0:18:37.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What the hell is this guy saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:42.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}These individualists began to appear after those GSDF helicopters flew around over the residential refugee sector.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.09,0:18:47.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}These people genuinely mean to liberate the refugees...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.39,0:18:47.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So there are cases of infection like this as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.47,0:18:53.20,Sign,,0,0,690,,{\b1\i1} {\fs52}{\b1}Sign: Heated Debate! The Refugee Issue and Terrorism{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.49,0:18:53.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes. We can't erode the police's dignity too much, so we thought he would be a\Ngood "spark" to set things off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.09,0:18:55.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.79,0:19:00.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,By the way, what about the infected who were involved in the\NNanyou case and the Prime Minister's attempted assassination?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.91,0:19:01.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.81,0:19:06.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Regarding the one involved in the Nanyou case,\Nwe've already manipulated Public Safety Section 1,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.11,0:19:07.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so I believe we will be able to purge him soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.31,0:19:11.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As for the one involved in the Prime\NMinister's attempted assassination,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.11,0:19:13.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we believe it is someone who was\Ndeployed to the Peninsula as a PKF member.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.28,0:19:15.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,His name is Kuze Hideo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.78,0:19:18.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We arrived at this conclusion by tracking\Nbackwards from the infectious agent,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.98,0:19:20.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so we probably have the right man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.38,0:19:22.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kuze-kun, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.72,0:19:28.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,About that man you asked about, Gouda:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.02,0:19:31.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,even though I asked my former coworkers\Nat the Bureau of Defence Policy,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.42,0:19:33.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,almost no one remembered anything about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.92,0:19:38.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And, even if they did remember him, they\Nonly recalled him being rather unremarkable,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.42,0:19:49.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, we did find records of the psychological testing\Nhe'd received while being considered for employment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:53.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"While introverted, subject possesses a strong\Nsense of self and exhibitionist tendencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:57.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,On the other hand, subject displays a\Ntendency to use others in order to assert himself."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.82,0:20:00.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Somewhat different from how I\Nvisualise his character to be today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:03.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's the matter? Aren't you going to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.08,0:20:06.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The taste hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.78,0:20:08.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It hasn't, eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.18,0:20:15.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, and about Kawashima, the SDF officer\Nyou asked me about...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.08,0:20:18.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Section 1 made an inquiry about him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.08,0:20:24.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They said that an assassin named Wong Chu Ren\Nhad stolen Kawashima's face and was hiding in Chinatown,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.58,0:20:26.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and requested the data on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.98,0:20:28.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why didn't you tell me that first?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.18,0:20:32.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But I thought you'd have been notified of this already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.78,0:20:33.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.38,0:20:35.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Setting the Nanyou case aside,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.98,0:20:37.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's strange that Section 1 is on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.18,0:20:39.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tell Batou and Togusa ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.08,0:20:41.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've already told them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.77,0:20:46.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Wong Chu Ren?\NHe's an international terrorist from Taiwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.47,0:20:49.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,An assassination order has been issued from above,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.57,0:20:51.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but I haven't received any\Ninformation about him switching his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.77,0:20:53.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Either we are being set up,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.67,0:20:55.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,or Section 1 is being set up...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.77,0:20:57.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Either way, the timing of it all is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.27,0:21:01.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tachikoma, secure the guys we\Nsaw back in that car, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.07,0:21:05.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou-San, the target has\Nappeared in the back of the restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.87,0:21:06.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.87,0:21:07.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.19,0:21:20.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This country's too extravagant for refugees to live in,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.19,0:21:24.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and yet it's not wealthy enough to take them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:30.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Wong Chu Ren, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.00,0:21:31.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.58,0:21:36.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Keep 'em there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.81,0:21:37.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.13,0:21:44.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Put the gun down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.05,0:21:46.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kawashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.60,0:21:52.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who the hell are you guys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.80,0:21:53.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.16,0:22:01.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.89,0:22:04.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The alley was too narrow for\Nme and I couldn't be his shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.14,0:22:06.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're Section 1, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.74,0:22:07.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And you guys are?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.24,0:22:09.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're in the same business.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.04,0:22:11.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Take a good look at this face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.04,0:22:13.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He hadn't made his face cybernetic yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.19,0:22:17.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In other words, this guy isn't Wong Chu Ren.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.75,0:22:19.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.25,0:22:22.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Section 1 had solid information on this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.65,0:22:25.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You guys are with Motoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.55,0:22:28.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It means you guys were duped.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.55,0:22:30.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.36,0:23:10.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Finding out a galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.86,0:23:14.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of planets and stars within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.86,0:23:17.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Listening to each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.73,0:23:20.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and singing the same silent melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.56,0:23:24.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never seen such beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.49,0:23:28.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.88,0:23:32.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No smack of doubt or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.56,0:23:35.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.16,0:23:35.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.99,0:23:37.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)\NI hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.16,0:23:37.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.55,0:23:39.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.\N(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.39,0:23:39.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.97,0:23:40.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)\Nhear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.05,0:23:41.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.93,0:23:42.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.13,0:23:43.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)\NI see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.73,0:23:44.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.06,0:23:46.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.\N(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.33,0:23:46.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.71,0:23:48.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.01,0:23:49.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.51,0:23:50.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,\N(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.10,0:23:50.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.98,0:23:51.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.\NAll I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.51,0:23:53.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.60,0:23:54.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(it's inside)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.86,0:23:57.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The beauty within the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.87,0:23:58.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(deep within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.29,0:24:00.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.27,0:24:01.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.85,0:24:02.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.77,0:24:03.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)\NI hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.77,0:24:04.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.25,0:24:06.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.86,0:24:07.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)\Nhear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.15,0:24:08.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.83,0:24:09.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.23,0:24:10.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside,\N(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.43,0:24:10.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.89,0:24:12.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.\N(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.93,0:24:13.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.37,0:24:15.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.67,0:24:15.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)\NAll the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.75,0:24:16.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.92,0:24:20.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.38,0:24:20.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside\Nto make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.42,0:24:21.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.77,0:24:26.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,right here within the shell.
